<tr><td>Date-stamped photos and video</td><td>Shows hail size, roof condition, and damage before tarping or repairs.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Weather records (NOAA, NWS)</td><td>Helps confirm hail fell at or near the property on the date of loss.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Roof inspection with test squares</td><td>Records hits per square, mat fractures, and functional damage by slope.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Itemized repair estimate</td><td>Line-item scope (often in Xactimate) for roofing, gutters, windows, and interior work.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Policy and declarations page</td><td>Confirms deductibles, roof payment schedules, and cosmetic damage endorsements.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Receipts for emergency repairs</td><td>Supports reimbursement for tarping and mitigation.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

